  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Mojonian Tales is an anthology of more than 20 games created by the Spanish group Mojon Twins brought together on a single NES cartridge. It contains a mix of older games that were previously available and are now refurbished or reprogrammed, NES ports of existing games for other platforms and entirely new games that were previously never available. There is a broad mix of genres such as action games, platformers, shooters and puzzle titles. Next to what is available right away there are also several hidden treasures and easter eggs even leading to complete games that are not advertised. The hidden games are accessed by entering code through an option in the main menu and the codes are revealed in several ways."
    }
  ],
